</a>.</p>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"art-title\">\n    <p><span>Artwork</span></p><h2 id=\"art-title\">Jon's pictures</h2>\n    <p>Jon Eggelton (JonEgg) re-imagined the Sabre Wulf loading screen in 2017. He drew the remaster's title screen too.</p>\n    <div>\n      <figure>\n        <p><a href=\"https://c64gfx.com/image/158936\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/img/art/sabre-wulf-reimagined.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" alt=\"Sabre Wulf Re-imagined by JonEgg, 2017\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n        <figcaption><strong>Sabre Wulf Re-imagined</strong> JonEgg, 2017. <a href=\"https://c64gfx.com/image/158936\" rel=\"noopener\">View on C64GFX</a> · <a href=\"https://csdb.dk/release/?id=158936\" rel=\"noopener\">CSDb</a></figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <p><img src=\"assets/img/art/title-screen.webp\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" alt=\"Sabre Wulf Remastered title screen: the Sabre Wulf logo in carved stone above glowing jungle\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n        <figcaption><strong>Sabre Wulf Remastered</strong> Title screen, by JonEgg.</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"boxed-title\">\n    <p><span>Mockup</span></p><h2 id=\"boxed-title\">If it came in a box<a href=\"#mockup-note\" aria-label=\"Note: this is a mockup\">*</a></h2>\n    <div>\n      <figure aria-label=\"Mockup of a Sabre Wulf Remastered game box\">\n        <div>\n            <P><svg viewBox=\"0 0 70 36\" width=\"70\" height=\"36\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"C64\"><text x=\"0\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"900\" font-style=\"italic\" letter-spacing=\"-1\">C64</text></svg></P>\n            <p><img src=\"assets/img/art/sabre-wulf-reimagined.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><span>DISK</span><span>REMASTERED</span><span>GENESIS PROJECT</span></p>\n          </div>\n      </figure>\n      <figure aria-label=\"Mockup of a Sab