\">*</a></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"If it came in a box*","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 70 36\" width=\"70\" height=\"36\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"C64\"><text x=\"0\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"900\" font-style=\"italic\" letter-spacing=\"-1\">C64</text></svg></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>DISK</span><span>REMASTERED</span><span>GENESIS PROJECT</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"DISKREMASTEREDGENESIS PROJECT","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><strong>Sabre Wulf Remastered</strong><span>Genesis Project</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Sabre Wulf RemasteredGenesis Project","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>More</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"more-title\">Explore the jungle</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Explore the jungle","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p id=\"mockup-note\">* The box and disk are a mockup. There is no boxed edition: Sabre Wulf Remastered will only be available as a digital download.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"* The box and disk are a mockup.","zh":null},{"en":"There is no boxed edition: Sabre Wulf Remastered will only be available as a digital download.","zh":null}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"main\">\n<div aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n    <div>\n      <p>Commodore 64 · Genesis Project</p>\n      <p>Ultimate's 1984 jungle maze, redrawn and reprogrammed for the Commodore 64.</p>\n      \n      <ul aria-label=\"At a glance\">\n        <li><strong>C64</strong> PAL</li>\n        <li>1 player</li>\n        <li>Joystick in port 2</li>\n        <li>D64 disk image</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <figure><img src=\"assets/img/shots/title.webp\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" alt=\"Title screen: Sabre Wulf Remastered, press fire to start\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></figure>\n  </div>\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"game-title\">\n    <div>\n      <p>The game</p><h2 id=\"game-title\">Lost in the jungle</h2>\n      <ul><li>256 screens of jungle. One way out.</li><li>Find the four pieces of the amulet and show them to the guardian.</li><li>Stab the small stuff. Run from the big stuff.</li><li>Flowers give strange powers for a while. Some good, some not.</li><li>Linger on one screen and a bushfire comes for you.</li><li>The Sabre Wulf hunts the south. Your sabre won't touch it.</li></ul>\n      <p>Story, controls and rules</p>\n    </div>\n    <figure>\n      <a href=\"assets/img/shots/wulf.webp\" data-view=\"shot\" data-title=\"The Sabre Wulf\"><img src=\"assets/img/shots/wulf.webp\" width=\"320\" height=\"264\" alt=\"The Sabre Wulf leaping at Sabreman, with the warning Beware of the Wulf\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>\n      <figcaption>Beware of the Wulf.</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"downloads-title\">\n    <p>下载</p><h2 id=\"downloads-title\">Get the game</h2>\n    <p>Every release so far, newest first. Each is a D64 disk image: see Loading.</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Sabre Wulf Remastered Genesis Project, 25 October 2026. The finished game. Download D64 (192 KB) G*P CSDb</li>\n      <li>Sabre Wulf Remastered +3 Shadow, 25 October 2026. Cracked, with three trainer options by Stormfront. Download D64 (192 KB) CSDb</li>\n      <li>Preview V0.5 +2 Triad. Cracked, with two trainer options. Download D64 (171 KB) CSDb</li>\n      <li>Preview V0.5 Genesis Project, 24 December 2025. Download D64 (192 KB) G*P CSDb</li>\n      <li>Preview V0.1 Genesis Project, 30 October 2022. Download D64 (192 KB) G*P CSDb</li>\n    </ul>\n    <h3 id=\"music-title\">The music</h3>\n    <p>The finished game's tunes as SID files, to play in a SID player or VICE.</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Intro and front end psych858o. 2 tunes. Download SID (4 KB)</li>\n      <li>Jungle (in game) Mermaid. One tune. Download SID (3 KB)</li>\n      <li>Suspended psych858o. One tune. Download SID (3 KB)</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Also on itch.io.</p>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"art-title\">\n    <p>Artwork</p><h2 id=\"art-title\">Jon's pictures</h2>\n    <p>Jon Eggelton (JonEgg) re-imagined the Sabre Wulf loading screen in 2017. He drew the remaster's title screen too.</p>\n    <div>\n      <figure>\n        <p><a href=\"https://c64gfx.com/image/158936\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/img/art/sabre-wulf-reimagined.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" alt=\"Sabre Wulf Re-imagined by JonEgg, 2017\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n        <figcaption>Sabre Wulf Re-imagined JonEgg, 2017. View on C64GFX · CSDb</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <p><img src=\"assets/img/art/title-screen.webp\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" alt=\"Sabre Wulf Remastered title screen: the Sabre Wulf logo in carved stone above glowing jungle\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n        <figcaption>Sabre Wulf Remastered Title screen, by JonEgg.</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"boxed-title\">\n    <p>Mockup</p><h2 id=\"boxed-title\">If it came in a box*</h2>\n    <div>\n      <figure aria-label=\"Mockup of a Sabre Wulf Remastered game box\">\n        <div>\n            <p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 70 36\" width=\"70\" height=\"36\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"C64\"><text x=\"0\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"900\" font-style=\"italic\" letter-spacing=\"-1\">C64</text></svg></p>\n            <p><img src=\"assets/img/art/sabre-wulf-reimagined.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>DISKREMASTEREDGENESIS PROJECT</p>\n          </div>\n      </figure>\n      <figure aria-label=\"Mockup of a Sabre Wulf Remastered 5.25 inch disk\"><div>\n          <p><img src=\"assets/img/art/title-screen.webp\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>Sabre Wulf RemasteredGenesis Project</p>\n        </div></figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"more-title\">\n    <p><span>More</span></p><h2 id=\"more-title\">Explore the jungle</h2>\n    \n    <p id=\"mockup-note\">* The box and disk are a mockup. There is no boxed edition: Sabre Wulf Remastered will only be available as a digital download.</p>\n  </div>\n</div></div>"}